// automations.memql
//
// (Empty.) Per-user agent provisioning is no longer an automation --
// the SeedMaterializer (component/memql/seed_materializer.go) walks
// the `seed` declarations in plannerAgent.memql / trainerAgent.memql /
// generalAssistant.memql at engine startup, and subscribes to
// graph.node.created.*.v1:identity:user for runtime fanout. The
// declarations themselves are the source of truth; the materializer
// turns them into v1:agents:agent rows.
//
// Historical:
//   provisionPlannerAgentOnUserCreate -- replaced by plannerAgent.memql
//   provisionTrainerAgentOnUserCreate -- replaced by trainerAgent.memql
//   (provisionGeneralAssistantOnUserCreate lived in copresent and is
//    deleted there in the companion commit.)
